#   2021.02.05: trying to solve the disappearing checkpoint problem
#   2021.02.04: corrected a mistake in erasedefectous
#   2021.02.01: added the case of missing eps/epsinf for a Generic solvent; attempts to resolve the misbehaviour of erasedefectous
